 "summary": "The PR adds one public theorem, which the roadmap needs for H3/H6/H7 and which is named to match the pair-of-pants compactness theorem. It also widens `contMDiff_uncurry_perturbation` and `contDiff_uncurry_perturbation` to `C^n` with `n` implicit, so the existing callers in `Plane/Action.lean` and `Plane/Curvature.lean` still work, and it adds no new definitions, compatibility aliases or exposed bodies.",
